(text "NOTES" (at 22.86 170.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a79b4036-40aa-5dcf-9cca-e8e27073918f))
(text "1. Board outline follows the Raspberry Pi HAT size (65 x 56.5 mm, M2.5 holes). No ID EEPROM is fitted." (at 22.86 173.99 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8bfdc9eb-7fb0-5f9f-806b-7e972c48a818))
(text "2. The Pi is powered through GPIO pins 2/4 (back-powering). On a Pi 5 add usb_max_current_enable=1 to config.txt." (at 22.86 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fb18f1b2-43d3-57d2-833c-a6246f8aaa2d))
(text "3. MT3608 modules differ slightly between sellers: match the IN+/IN-/OUT+/OUT- labels on the PCB to the module." (at 22.86 181.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3c7feeeb-a255-5c14-946d-a85b97200175))
(text "4. PJ-063AH jacks fit 5.5 x 2.1 mm plugs and are rated 8 A / 24 V." (at 22.86 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 91bf7733-c544-5d3d-b51e-8ceee25b2954))
